#: ../../../builtins-hard.rst:32
msgid ""
"Banker's rounding (round half to even) applies to every ``.5`` case: ``0.5``"
" -> ``0``, ``1.5`` -> ``2``, ``2.5`` -> ``2``. Each result is the nearest "
"*even* integer."
msgstr ""
"El redondeo bancario (redondeo al par más cercano) se aplica en cada caso "
"``.5``: ``0.5`` -> ``0``, ``1.5`` -> ``2``, ``2.5`` -> ``2``. Cada resultado"
" es el entero *par* más cercano."

#: ../../../builtins-hard.rst:50
msgid "``0.3``"
msgstr "``0.3``"

#: ../../../builtins-hard.rst:51
msgid "``0.30000000000000001``"
msgstr "``0.30000000000000001``"

#: ../../../builtins-hard.rst:52
msgid "``0.29999999999999999``"
msgstr "``0.29999999999999999``"

#: ../../../builtins-hard.rst:53
msgid "``0.30000000000000004``"
msgstr "``0.30000000000000004``"

#: ../../../builtins-hard.rst:58
msgid ""
"Binary floating point cannot represent ``0.1`` or ``0.2`` exactly, so the "
"sum is slightly above ``0.3`` and ``repr`` shows the shortest string that "
"round-trips: ``0.30000000000000004``."
msgstr ""
"La coma flotante binaria no puede representar ``0.1`` ni ``0.2`` de forma "
"exacta, así que la suma queda ligeramente por encima de ``0.3`` y ``repr`` "
"muestra la cadena más corta que reproduce el mismo valor: "
"``0.30000000000000004``."

